# Deprecations triggered inside Sulu and Symfony that this bundle cannot fix.
#
# The deprecation helper blames whichever test booted the kernel, so a deprecation raised while
# Sulu's container compiles lands in the `self` bucket and trips `max[self]=0`. Listing them here
# keeps that threshold meaningful for the deprecations the bundle really does trigger itself.
#
# Sulu 3.0 still enables Doctrine annotations, which framework-bundle deprecates from 6.4 on.
# Only the `lowest` job installs a Symfony that still has these services, so this file can go
# once the supported floor moves past them.
%The "annotations\.(reader|cached_reader|cache_adapter|cache_warmer)" service is deprecated without replacement\.%
